  "body": "What happens: the recorded stream `drill_full_diameter` (`crates/post/tests/recorded/streams/drill_full_diameter.cnc`) does not post through `heidenhain-klartext.cps`. Without a machine, the post stops on the missing controller profile. On `assets/machines/fehlmann-picomax55.mch`, the post stops with this error:\n\n```\nHeidenhain Klartext: unsupported milling tool kind (unstated)\n```\n\nThe recorded stream states no tool kind. Thus no Klartext golden records the full-diameter drilling depth (12.803).\n\nExpected: a Klartext NC golden of this case with the cycle depth.\n\nEvidence: the guard `recorded_streams::each_drilling_post_records_the_full_diameter_depth` (PR #4380) names this post in `recorded::DRILL_DEPTH_GAP`.\n\nFound while fixing the review of PR #4380 (#2528).\n\nDone means: the Klartext post records `drill_full_diameter` (plain or `_on_machine`) as an NC golden with the depth 12.803, and `heidenhain-klartext` is removed from `DRILL_DEPTH_GAP`.\n",
